OL,3,GNEWSAPCSO passed police information to
OL,4,Amachete gang
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire police community
OL,7,Fsupport officer has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof passing confidential information to
OL,9,Fmembers of a gang behind a machete
OL,10,Fattack which resulted in one man having
OL,11,Fhis hand cut off.
OL,13,FAlice Dobson, 31, was found guilty of
OL,14,Fsharing details of the police
OL,15,Finvestigation with Rahees Khan, 43, who
OL,16,Fwas one of five men found guilty of
OL,17,Fconspiracy to murder.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
