OL,3,GNEWSAPCSO passed police information to
OL,4,Amachete gang
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Crown Court heard victim Zayad
OL,7,FKhan has his left hand severed and his
OL,8,Fright leg partially amputated in the
OL,9,Fattack in Bradford in 2025. A second
OL,10,Fman was also injured.
OL,12,FThe verdicts in the trial were returned
OL,13,Fby Judge Jonathan Rose after he
OL,14,Fdischarged the jury following
OL,15,Fallegations of jury tampering.
